      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The [`sensorHeight`](scncamera/sensorheight.md) and [`focalLength`](scncamera/focallength.md) properties determine the camera’s horizontal and vertical viewing angles using terms that model physical camera devices.",
